* Brig Receiver — System Integration Demo
* Antenna (2-port Touchstone) → LNA → Bandpass Filter → Output
*
* Demonstrates that the exported antenna S-parameter model works in a
* realistic receive chain: signal arrives at the antenna space port,
* passes through the 2-port, gets amplified by the LNA, filtered, and
* delivered to the output.
*
* Run from the repository root:
*     ngspice -b work/ngspice/system/system_integration.net

* ---- signal source (emulates received plane wave at antenna port 2) ----
* 1 V AC at each band centre (three sequential AC analyses)
Vsig    sig  0  dc 0  ac 1
Rsrc    sig  sp 50

* ---- antenna 2-port (port 1 = feed, port 2 = space) ----
Xant    fda  sp  0  ANT_CHA  touchstone="sim/outputs/ngspice/ant_cha.s2p"

* ---- LNA model: Av=20 dB (x10), Rin=Rout=50 Ω ----
*   topology: input shunt 50 Ω, VCVS gain 10, output series 50 Ω
*   Vout = Av * V(fda)  with Rin and Rout matched.
Rlna_in   fda   0     50
Elna      lna_v 0     fda  0  10
Rlna_out  lna_v lna_o 50

* ---- 2nd-order bandpass filter (Q=5, centre = band frequency) ----
*   Each AC sweep sets .param fc to the band centre.
*   The filter is a series RLC (series with signal path) in shunt:
*       input node lna_o → L → C → output node filt_out
*       R sets Q.
*   For the Ch A sweep (fc=200 MHz):
.param fc=200meg
Lbp    lna_o  filt_mid  {1/(2*3.14159*fc)*50/3.14159/fc} IC=0
Cbp    filt_mid  filt_out  {1/(4*3.14159*3.14159*fc*fc*Lbp)}
Rbp    filt_out  0  50

* ---- output load ----
Rload  filt_out  0  50

.include sim/outputs/ngspice/ant_sparams.lib

.control

* ---- Ch A: 50 MHz – 900 MHz ----
.ac lin 201 50e6 900e6
let v_out = v(filt_out)
let gain_db = db(v_out) - db(vsig)      ; system gain dB
wrdata /tmp/opencode/sys_cha.dat gain_db
print v(filt_out) v(fda)

* ---- Ch B: 1.2 – 3.0 GHz ----
* (reuses same circuit; fc param affects filter, L/C re-evaluated)
.ac lin 201 1.2e9 3.0e9
let v_out = v(filt_out)
let gain_db = db(v_out) - db(vsig)
wrdata /tmp/opencode/sys_chb.dat gain_db
print v(filt_out) v(fda)

* ---- Ch C: 4.0 – 7.0 GHz ----
.ac lin 201 4.0e9 7.0e9
let v_out = v(filt_out)
let gain_db = db(v_out) - db(vsig)
wrdata /tmp/opencode/sys_chc.dat gain_db
print v(filt_out) v(fda)

.endc

.END
